      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذَهُ المُقِيمُ المُقْعِدُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  (A) <i>Griefs took hold upon
him, disquieting him so that he could not remain
at rest, and making him to stand up and sit
down:</i> a phrase similar to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذَهُ مَا قَدُمَ وَمَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدُثَ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا قَرُبَ وَمَا بَعُدَ</span>. (Mgh, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قدم</span>.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقْعِدٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَعِّدٌ</span></b>  <i>A servant.</i> (IAar, L.)

